    <h1>MarketLink — Project Installation & Evaluation Guide</h1>
    <p><strong>Theme:</strong> eGreen Basket<br>
    <strong>Category:</strong> End-to-End Web Solutions<br>
    <strong>Specification:</strong> Software Requirements Specification (SRS) v1.0</p>

    <div class="highlight">
        <strong>Mandatory Evaluation Summary:</strong> MarketLink connects local farmers-market vendors with community customers for weekly produce visibility, interactive OpenStreetMap stall discovery, and pre-orders. In strict compliance with SRS Section 1.5, payment is settled in person upon stall pickup (no online gateway) and all orders are pickup-only (no couriers).
    </div>

